mord   | r/6           | c5/2 r/4      | r/6           | r/6           |
bass   | g2/2 r/4      | c3/2 r/4      | a2/2 r/4      | g2/2 r/4      |
chords | r/2 [b3,d4,g4]' [b3,d4,g4]' | r/2 [b3,d4,g4]' [b3,d4,g4]' | r/2 [a3,c4,e4]' [a3,c4,e4]' | r/2 [b3,d4,g4]' [b3,d4,g4]' |

lead   | d5/3 e5/1 f#5/2 | r/2 d5/1@100 d5/1@70 d5/1@85 d5/1@70    | c5/2 b4 c5    | d5/1@100 d5/1@70 d5/1@85 d5/1@70 d5/1@80 d5/1@65          |
mord   | r/6           | e5/2 r/4      | r/6           | r/6           |
